From 98c305b3ec8d03693f4dc94bade69035cb15ff7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Rajan <7121943+kvnloo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 04:03:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(plugin-catalog): add paw-pii

List the standalone PAW-PII Hermes plugin (kvnloo/pii, subdir
integrations/hermes) at an exact 40-hex pin. The plugin redacts PII on
the device with the ProgramAsWeights PII program before provider egress.

The capabilities block matches what register() wires at the pinned
commit: the detect_pii and redact_pii tools, plus llm_request and
tool_execution middleware. The description discloses the first-use
downloads (program bundle from programasweights.com, base model from
Hugging Face), local llama.cpp inference, and fail-open behaviour.
readme is off because the plugin subdirectory has no README; docs_url
points at the repository README section at the pinned commit.

Refs #102922

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 plugin-catalog/paw-pii.yaml | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 plugin-catalog/paw-pii.yaml

diff --git a/plugin-catalog/paw-pii.yaml b/plugin-catalog/paw-pii.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..845dc6cce7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/plugin-catalog/paw-pii.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+name: paw-pii
+repo: https://github.com/kvnloo/pii
+sha: d891ebdd3a3dab27a3451923eb56f955253a2782
+subdir: integrations/hermes
+description: "On-device PII detection and redaction using the ProgramAsWeights PII program (model and library by programasweights/pii; Hermes integration by kvnloo). Adds detect_pii and redact_pii tools, plus llm_request and tool_execution middleware that replace names, emails, phone numbers, secrets and other PII with a placeholder in provider requests and tool results. Disclosure: on first use the PAW program bundle downloads from programasweights.com and a ~600 MB base model from Hugging Face; after that, inference runs locally through llama.cpp and no text is sent to a remote service. Redaction fails open: if the program or its runtime cannot load, requests and tool results pass through unchanged. Every string in a request is scanned separately, so long conversations add local inference time per turn."
+maintainer: kvnloo
+tier: community
+category: tools
+version: "0.1.0"
+docs_url: https://github.com/kvnloo/pii/blob/d891ebdd3a3dab27a3451923eb56f955253a2782/README.md#agent-harness-plugins
+readme: false
+capabilities:
+  provides_tools:
+    - detect_pii
+    - redact_pii
+  provides_hooks: []
+  provides_middleware:
+    - llm_request
+    - tool_execution
+  requires_env: []
-- 
2.55.0

